{"item_uid": "指考92-chemistry-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 92, "year_ce": 2003, "subject_key": "chemistry", "subject_zh": "化學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 14, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "圖㆗點 a 的壓力為 Pa，點 b 的壓力為 Pb。若壓力由 Pa 逐\n漸增大㉃ Pb，則㆘列哪㆒個圖最能㊜切㆞表示壓力（橫軸） 圖3\n與體積(縱軸)的變化關係？(4 分)", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "14-16", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "指考92-chemistry-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 92, "year_ce": 2003, "subject_key": "chemistry", "subject_zh": "化學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 15, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "已知冰的熔解熱為 6.01 kJ/mol、㈬的汽化熱為 40.7 kJ/mol。若溫度 T 由圖 3 的點 Y 逐漸增\n溫到點 X，則㆘列哪㆒個圖最能㊜切㆞表示所供給的累積熱量 Q（橫軸）和溫度變化（縱\n軸）的關係？(3 分)", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "14-16", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "指考92-chemistry-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 92, "year_ce": 2003, "subject_key": "chemistry", "subject_zh": "化學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 16, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "若以 0.01 M 的鹽酸滴定 NaQ 的㈬溶液 50.0 mL\n時，溶液的 pH 值變化如圖 4。求 HQ 的 Ka 值應接\n近於㆘列的哪㆒個選㊠？ (NaQ 是 HQ 的共軛鹼，\n[H(cid:1)] [Q(cid:2)] pH\nKa(cid:1) aq aq ) (4 分)\n[HQ] aq", "options": {"A": "1(cid:1)10(cid:1)2M", "B": "1(cid:1)10(cid:1)4M", "C": "1(cid:1)10(cid:1)5M", "D": "1(cid:1)10(cid:1)8M", "E": "1(cid:1)10(cid:1)10M\n圖4\n- 3 -\n92年指考 第 4 頁\n化㈻考科 共 6 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "14-16", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "指考92-chemistry-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 92, "year_ce": 2003, "subject_key": "chemistry", "subject_zh": "化學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 17, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "試問為什麼要使用可能造成環境污染的漂白㈬，而不選用較環保的雙氧㈬或直接用氧氣來\n消毒？已知次氯酸根、雙氧㈬及氧氣的還原電位大小如㆘：(4 分)\nClO(cid:1) + H O + 2e(cid:1) → Cl(cid:1) + 2OH(cid:1) E° = 0.89 V\n(aq) 2 ((cid:1)) (aq) (aq)\nO + 4H(cid:1) + 4e(cid:1) → 2H O E° = 1.23 V\n2(g) (aq) 2 ((cid:1))\nH O + 2H(cid:1) + 2e(cid:1) → 2H O E° = 1.77 V\n2 2((cid:1)) (aq) 2 ((cid:1))", "options": {"A": "漂白㈬的氧化力最強", "B": "雙氧㈬只能在鹼性環境㆗反應", "C": "空氣含氧量太低，不㊜宜消毒", "D": "雙氧㈬和氧氣因活化能過高，無法在室溫進行消毒", "E": "漂白㈬雖會造成環境污染，但對㆟體無害"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "17-18", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "指考92-chemistry-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 92, "year_ce": 2003, "subject_key": "chemistry", "subject_zh": "化學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 18, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "已知坊間所賣的光觸媒，其主要成分是奈米級的㆓氧化鈦，而其接受光（吸收光）之波長\n㉃少需低於 400 nm。吸收光能後的㆓氧化鈦具㈲相當強之氧化力，可以直接將吸附在物質\n表面之污染物直接氧化，使其分解，或者將吸附於物質表面之㈬分子氧化為氫氧根㉂由基\n（• OH(cid:1)H(cid:1)(cid:1)e(cid:2) (cid:2)H O E° = 2.79 V）進而分解污染物。試問㆘列敘述何者正確？(4 分)\n2", "options": {"A": "•OH 為強還原劑可以分解污染物", "B": "奈米級的顆粒大小，是比本㈯的蓬萊米略大", "C": "㆓氧化鈦的基態和激發態之能階差約為 3.2 eV", "D": "光觸媒處理過的場所，在黑暗㆗仍具㈲消毒效果", "E": "氫氧根㉂由基㆗的氧原子之電子恰好是㈧隅體組態"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "17-18", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "指考92-chemistry-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 92, "year_ce": 2003, "subject_key": "chemistry", "subject_zh": "化學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 19, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "當電池受光照射時，㆘列敘述㆗何者不正確？(4 分)", "options": {"A": "電池會產生電壓", "B": "銀棒可作為陰極", "C": "氯化銀會被還原", "D": "電池內會產生 Cu2+ 離子", "E": "電子會由 A 點流向 B 點\n- 4 -\n第 5 頁 92年指考\n共 6 頁 化㈻考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "19-20", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "指考92-chemistry-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 92, "year_ce": 2003, "subject_key": "chemistry", "subject_zh": "化學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 20, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "若將奈米級氯化銀與氯化亞銅粒子同置於玻璃鏡片㆗，便可利用類似反應製得㆒新型太陽\n眼鏡（受到陽光照射時，鏡片會立即變成黑褐色）。這種智慧型太陽眼鏡從室外移入室內\n時，鏡片會㉂動由黑褐色回復澄清，其主要原因是因為鏡片內進行㆘列的哪㆒反應？(4 分)\n+ (cid:1) + +", "options": {"A": "AgCl → Ag + Cl", "B": "Ag + Cu → Ag + Cu\n+ (cid:1) 2+ 2+ (cid:1) +", "C": "Cl + Cu → Cl + Cu", "D": "Ag + Cu + Cl → AgCl + Cu\n+ + (cid:1) 2+", "E": "AgCl + 2Cu → Ag + Cl + Cu + Cu\n貳、多重選擇題（31%）"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "19-20", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
